sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Attacker
    participant App as "Web App"
    participant Bot as "Admin Bot / Chromium"

    Attacker->>App: Đăng ký và đăng nhập user thường
    Attacker->>App: POST /immortal-gate/report<br/>URL = /immortal-gate/check?name=[payload XSS]
    App-->>Attacker: Đã gửi URL cho admin bot

    Bot->>App: GET /immortal-gate/sign-in
    Bot->>App: POST /immortal-gate/sign-in<br/>username=admin, password=ADMIN_PASSWORD
    App-->>Bot: Set session admin + csrf_token thật

    Bot->>App: GET /immortal-gate/check?name=[payload XSS]
    App-->>Bot: Response thiếu Content-Type, chứa payload HTML/JS
    Note over Bot: Chromium MIME-sniff response thành HTML<br/>và thực thi script trong origin của app

    Bot->>Bot: document.cookie = 'csrf_token=123； path=/cultivation/password'
    Bot->>App: GET /cultivation/password<br/>Cookie csrf_token=123<br/>Header x-csrf-token: 123
    App-->>Bot: Đổi password admin thành chuỗi rỗng

    Attacker->>App: POST /immortal-gate/sign-in<br/>username=admin, password=
    App-->>Attacker: Set session admin
    Attacker->>App: POST /immortal-gate/treasure
    App-->>Attacker: Trả flag